      "body": "@mintunitish give it a go ^_^\r\n\r\nThis is my proposal for how to solve it:\r\n- Add an option to the init-script where the service-provider can link to their terms of service (it should either take no value or a valid URL as input)\r\n- If option is in use, link to it from the register account page\r\n- If option is in use, add checkbox that needs to checked to be able to create account\r\n\r\nYou can use the same methods I used in https://github.com/solid/node-solid-server/pull/869, namely `processHandlebarFile` in `lib/common/template-utils.js` to handle the variables.",
